		(property "Note" "HAT-out comes off the backed-up bus, so the HAT's K-line transceiver and TMAP supply stay in spec through a crank dip (the LTC3350 holds the bus >= 9 V). Replaces the switched TPS1HB35 (trimmed 2026-10-13). The HAT's own V12_SENSE then reads the bus, not the battery; PWR measures the battery (VIN_SENSE, LTC3350 meas_vin)."
			(at 198.12 40.64 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
